## GATE 3: ALGORITHMIC TITLE GENERATION & SELECTION

**Title Generation (8 Required) - Enhanced with Competitive Intelligence:**

Generate titles using proven formulas informed by Gate 2 research:

- **How-to**: "How to [Primary Keyword] [Benefit/Timeframe]" + competitor approaches found
- **List**: "X [Primary Keyword] [Superlative] for [Target Audience]" + number patterns seen
- **Question**: "What [Primary Keyword] [Pain Point/Benefit]?" + gaps identified  
- **Comparison**: "[Primary Keyword] vs [Alternative]: [Unique Angle]" + alternatives found
- **Problem-solution**: "Why [Common Problem] + How [Primary Keyword] Solves It" + pain points discovered
- **Benefit-focused**: "[Primary Keyword] That Actually [Desired Outcome]" + outcomes emphasized by competitors
- **Time-sensitive**: "[Primary Keyword] in [Timeframe]: [Specific Promise]" + effective timeframes found
- **Mistake-prevention**: "X [Primary Keyword] Mistakes [Target Audience] Make" + common issues found

**Selection Scoring (Rate each title 1-10, total /60):**
- Search Optimization (vs competitor patterns)
- Multi-Platform Appeal (vs successful patterns identified) 
- Deliverability (vs what competitors deliver)
- Competitive Differentiation (vs Gate 2 analysis)
- Engagement Triggers (vs competitor triggers)
- Click-Through Potential (vs high-performing titles)

**Title Selection & Meta Description:**
- [ ] Select highest scorer automatically
- [ ] Create compelling 140-160 character meta description with primary keyword in first 100 characters

