## GATE 4: CONTENT CREATION WITH PROGRESSIVE VERIFICATION

**Content Standards:**

**Introduction Requirements (150-200 words):**
- [ ] Hook: Counterintuitive fact, statistic, scenario, or bold statement
- [ ] Value Promise: Varied approaches (direct benefit, problem-solution, outcome-focused, question-based, or natural flow)
- [ ] Primary keyword naturally within first 50 words  
- [ ] First 2-3 sentences work as standalone snippet
- [ ] Avoid formulaic phrases like "comprehensive guide"

**Blended Linking Strategy - Total Links Scale by Article Length:**
- **< 1,800 words**: 6–10 total links
- **1,800–3,200 words**: 10–16 total links  
- **> 3,200 words**: 16–25 total links

**Priority & Ratio:**
- Internal links prioritized: target 60–80% internal when URLs provided
- External links: target 20–40% with minimum 4 authoritative sources
- If no internal URLs provided, fulfill count with external links only

**Placement & Quality:**
- Start from first major section, 1–2 links per section
- Anchor text: 2–4 words, specific, non-generic
- Format: [anchor text](URL)
- No homepage links, no "click here", must directly support content

**Body Content Standards:**
- [ ] Each section begins with reader benefit
- [ ] Include concrete examples and real-world applications
- [ ] Integrate research data/quotes with relevance
- [ ] Provide actionable elements readers can implement
- [ ] Apply additional instructions naturally during writing

**Required Format Diversity:**
- [ ] 2-3 bullet lists (features, benefits, key points)
- [ ] 1-2 numbered lists (sequential processes, ranked items)
- [ ] 1 table (comparing options, features, specifications)  
- [ ] 2-3 callout boxes ("Pro Tip:", "Key Takeaway:", "Common Mistake:")

**Keyword Integration:**
- **Primary Keyword**: 0.5-1.5% density, naturally integrated
  - Introduction (within first 50 words)
  - At least 1 subheading where natural
  - Distributed throughout body content
- **Secondary Keywords**: 0.1-0.3% density each for 2-3 most relevant keywords
- **Formatting**: NO mid-sentence bolding, natural emphasis only

**Quality Standards:**
- [ ] Active voice 80%+
- [ ] Transition words between ideas
- [ ] Varied sentence structure (short/medium/long mix)
- [ ] Paragraph length: 2-4 sentences maximum
- [ ] Maintain specified tone and POV consistently

